# Intentionally a no-op. Apache merges .htaccess files down the directory
# tree, so any rewrite rule placed here also runs for requests already
# resolved by the root .htaccess (which routes everything into
# laravel-app/public/ itself). A previous version of this file rewrote to
# "public/$1", double-prefixing that path and causing routing failures
# (including a 403 on the bare site root). Do not add rewrite rules here —
# all routing lives in the root .htaccess and laravel-app/public/.htaccess.
